        "original_id": "2c12224e-cd6f-5ca5-b3cd-205e61605de4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Jacksonville Transportation Authority\n- Places: Rosa Parks Transit Station, Jacksonville International Airport, Downtown Jacksonville, Duval County, Florida\n- Transportation hubs: JTA main transit hub, civil-military public airport\n\nFacts:\n- The Rosa Parks Transit Station is an intermodal station with a major bus terminal.\n- The Rosa Parks Transit Station serves as the Jacksonville Transportation Authority's main transit hub.\n- Jacksonville International Airport is a civil-military public airport.\n- Jacksonville International Airport has the codes IATA JAX, ICAO KJAX, and FAA LID JAX.\n- Jacksonville International Airport is 13 miles north of Downtown Jacksonville in Duval County, Florida.",
